{"3983200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "FiresOut!", "steam_appid": 3983200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FiresOut! is a chaotic co-op game you can play online or from your sofa with up to 4 players, where teamwork can work wonders ... or cause disasters! Play as animal firefighting interns who definitely did not sign up to extinguish fires with a toilet fish, but here you are, bracing yourself and saving civilians in hazardous and complex levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/extras/03df5ab32f1ea4885f922313c13ee3a5.poster.avif?t=1787672146\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/extras/03df5ab32f1ea4885f922313c13ee3a5.webm?t=1787672146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/extras/03df5ab32f1ea4885f922313c13ee3a5.mp4?t=1787672146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>TEAMWORK MAKES THE FISH WORK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up to aim Mr. Glug Glug, a goldfish living in a toilet who blasts water like a fire hose. Make sure to manage the recoils so hang on to your (toilet) seat!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/extras/8ebd5d813fe0d6e895212080ff56034e.poster.avif?t=1787672146\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/extras/8ebd5d813fe0d6e895212080ff56034e.webm?t=1787672146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/extras/8ebd5d813fe0d6e895212080ff56034e.mp4?t=1787672146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>SQUEEZE THE DAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate tight corridors, winding stairs, falling debris and the occasional meteorites while hauling your tools across burning chaos. With spaces this cramped, you'll need teamwork, timing and maybe a little friendly shoving to squeeze through in one piece.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/extras/144846cb1d9dc2dcb952337e83b302d8.poster.avif?t=1787672146\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/extras/144846cb1d9dc2dcb952337e83b302d8.webm?t=1787672146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/extras/144846cb1d9dc2dcb952337e83b302d8.mp4?t=1787672146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>GRAB 'N' GO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scoop up fire victims and haul them to safety. Just don't forget to douse them first!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight fires solo or up to 4 players as firefighting interns. Support both local couch or online chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toilet gold fish as your fire extinguisher (his name's Mr Glug Glug).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry victims or yeet them. They're covered by insurance, anyway.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive your fire truck between 5 wacky worlds with unique game mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meteorites, exploding fireballs. Wait... we shouldn't send interns for this.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FiresOut! is a chaotic co-op game you can play online or from your sofa with up to 4 players, where teamwork can work wonders ... or cause disasters! Play as animal firefighting interns who definitely did not sign up to extinguish fires with a toilet fish, but here you are, bracing yourself and saving civilians in hazardous and complex levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/extras/03df5ab32f1ea4885f922313c13ee3a5.poster.avif?t=1787672146\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/extras/03df5ab32f1ea4885f922313c13ee3a5.webm?t=1787672146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/extras/03df5ab32f1ea4885f922313c13ee3a5.mp4?t=1787672146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>TEAMWORK MAKES THE FISH WORK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up to aim Mr. Glug Glug, a goldfish living in a toilet who blasts water like a fire hose. Make sure to manage the recoils so hang on to your (toilet) seat!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/extras/8ebd5d813fe0d6e895212080ff56034e.poster.avif?t=1787672146\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/extras/8ebd5d813fe0d6e895212080ff56034e.webm?t=1787672146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/extras/8ebd5d813fe0d6e895212080ff56034e.mp4?t=1787672146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>SQUEEZE THE DAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate tight corridors, winding stairs, falling debris and the occasional meteorites while hauling your tools across burning chaos. With spaces this cramped, you'll need teamwork, timing and maybe a little friendly shoving to squeeze through in one piece.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/extras/144846cb1d9dc2dcb952337e83b302d8.poster.avif?t=1787672146\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/extras/144846cb1d9dc2dcb952337e83b302d8.webm?t=1787672146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/extras/144846cb1d9dc2dcb952337e83b302d8.mp4?t=1787672146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>GRAB 'N' GO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scoop up fire victims and haul them to safety. Just don't forget to douse them first!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight fires solo or up to 4 players as firefighting interns. Support both local couch or online chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toilet gold fish as your fire extinguisher (his name's Mr Glug Glug).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry victims or yeet them. They're covered by insurance, anyway.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive your fire truck between 5 wacky worlds with unique game mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meteorites, exploding fireballs. Wait... we shouldn't send interns for this.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "short_description": "FiresOut! is a chaotic co-op firefighting game for 1 to 4 players. As new interns of the Super Hazard Intervention Taskforce (SHIT), you and your friends must fight fires &amp; rescue victims with only the tool that your captain gave; a toilet goldfish that shoots water. Is your internship 